  ('an3', 'anat', null, 2, 'recall', null, 'Which part of a long bone does the bracket mark?', 'The diaphysis (the shaft).', 'The diaphysis is a tube of compact bone around the medullary cavity, which holds marrow. The rounded ends are the epiphyses; in children the growth plate sits between the two.', null, null, null, 'data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D''http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg''%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20viewBox%3D''0%200%20480%20300''%20font-family%3D''Helvetica%2CArial%2Csans-serif''%3E%3Crect%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D''%23f3e8d0''%20stroke%3D''%23a16207''%20stroke-width%3D''5''%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''112''%20cy%3D''130''%20r%3D''30''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''112''%20cy%3D''174''%20r%3D''30''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''368''%20cy%3D''130''%20r%3D''30''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''368''%20cy%3D''174''%20r%3D''30''%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D''118''%20y%3D''130''%20width%3D''244''%20height%3D''44''%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D''%23f3e8d0''%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''112''%20cy%3D''130''%20r%3D''28''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''112''%20cy%3D''174''%20r%3D''28''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''368''%20cy%3D''130''%20r%3D''28''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''368''%20cy%3D''174''%20r%3D''28''%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D''110''%20y%3D''132.5''%20width%3D''260''%20height%3D''39''%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D''M146%20116%20V102%20H334%20V116''%20fill%3D''none''%20stroke%3D''%230f172a''%20stroke-width%3D''2.5''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''240''%20cy%3D''80''%20r%3D''16''%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''240''%20y%3D''87''%20text-anchor%3D''middle''%20font-size%3D''19''%20font-weight%3D''700''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%3E%3F%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D''240''%20y%3D''290''%20text-anchor%3D''middle''%20font-size%3D''12''%20fill%3D''%2364748b''%3EA%20long%20bone%2C%20such%20as%20the%20femur%20(simplified)%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E', null, null, null),
  ('an4', 'anat', null, 3, 'recall', null, 'Name the four abdominal quadrants and one key organ in each.', 'RUQ: liver and gallbladder. LUQ: stomach and spleen. RLQ: appendix. LLQ: sigmoid colon.', 'Quadrants are named from the patient''s side, so the patient''s right is on your left. Pain in the RLQ can point to appendicitis. When assessing the abdomen, listen before you palpate so you don''t change the bowel sounds.', null, null, null, null, 'data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D''http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg''%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20viewBox%3D''0%200%20480%20300''%20font-family%3D''Helvetica%2CArial%2Csans-serif''%3E%3Crect%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D''140''%20y%3D''40''%20width%3D''200''%20height%3D''230''%20rx%3D''42''%20fill%3D''%23f8fafc''%20stroke%3D''%2364748b''%20stroke-width%3D''3''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D''M240%2040%20V270%20M140%20155%20H340''%20stroke%3D''%2364748b''%20stroke-width%3D''2''%20stroke-dasharray%3D''6%205''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''240''%20cy%3D''155''%20r%3D''5''%20fill%3D''%2364748b''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20text-anchor%3D''middle''%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%3E%3Cg%20font-size%3D''17''%20font-weight%3D''700''%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''190''%20y%3D''88''%3ERUQ%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''290''%20y%3D''88''%3ELUQ%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''190''%20y%3D''204''%3ERLQ%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''290''%20y%3D''204''%3ELLQ%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20font-size%3D''12.5''%20fill%3D''%23334155''%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''190''%20y%3D''108''%3ELiver%2C%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''190''%20y%3D''124''%3Egallbladder%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''290''%20y%3D''108''%3EStomach%2C%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''290''%20y%3D''124''%3Espleen%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''190''%20y%3D''224''%3EAppendix%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''290''%20y%3D''224''%3ESigmoid%20colon%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20font-size%3D''12''%20fill%3D''%