  ('an5', 'anat', null, 4, 'recall', null, 'What are the three layers of the skin, from the surface down?', 'Epidermis, dermis, hypodermis (subcutaneous tissue).', 'The epidermis has no blood vessels. The dermis holds vessels, nerves, hair follicles and glands. The hypodermis is mostly fat, and it is where subcutaneous injections go.', null, null, null, null, 'data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D''http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg''%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20viewBox%3D''0%200%20480%20300''%20font-family%3D''Helvetica%2CArial%2Csans-serif''%3E%3Crect%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D''50''%20y%3D''40''%20width%3D''250''%20height%3D''35''%20fill%3D''%23f5d0a9''%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D''50''%20y%3D''75''%20width%3D''250''%20height%3D''110''%20fill%3D''%23fbc8c8''%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D''50''%20y%3D''185''%20width%3D''250''%20height%3D''70''%20fill%3D''%23fde68a''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D''M50%20150%20C95%20128%20130%20172%20175%20148%20S255%20128%20300%20150''%20fill%3D''none''%20stroke%3D''%23dc2626''%20stroke-width%3D''3''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D''%23fef9c3''%20stroke%3D''%23eab308''%20stroke-width%3D''1.5''%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''85''%20cy%3D''220''%20r%3D''20''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''135''%20cy%3D''222''%20r%3D''22''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''187''%20cy%3D''219''%20r%3D''20''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''236''%20cy%3D''222''%20r%3D''21''%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''280''%20cy%3D''220''%20r%3D''16''%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D''50''%20y%3D''40''%20width%3D''250''%20height%3D''215''%20fill%3D''none''%20stroke%3D''%2364748b''%20stroke-width%3D''3''%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D''M50%2075%20H300%20M50%20185%20H300''%20stroke%3D''%2364748b''%20stroke-width%3D''2''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%3E%3Cg%20font-size%3D''15''%20font-weight%3D''700''%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''315''%20y%3D''63''%3EEpidermis%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''315''%20y%3D''128''%3EDermis%3C%2Ftex