  ('an6', 'anat', null, 5, 'recall', null, 'Trace the path of blood through the four chambers of the heart, starting as it returns from the body.', 'Right atrium → right ventricle → lungs → left atrium → left ventricle → body.', 'The right side sends oxygen-poor blood to the lungs through the pulmonary artery; the left side sends oxygen-rich blood to the body through the aorta.', null, null, null, null, 'data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D''http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg''%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20viewBox%3D''0%200%20480%20300''%20font-family%3D''Helvetica%2CArial%2Csans-serif''%3E%3Crect%20width%3D''480''%20height%3D''300''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Cg%20stroke-width%3D''3''%20stroke-linejoin%3D''round''%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D''120''%20y%3D''44''%20width%3D''110''%20height%3D''72''%20rx%3D''18''%20fill%3D''%23dbeafe''%20stroke%3D''%232563eb''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D''250''%20y%3D''44''%20width%3D''110''%20height%3D''72''%20rx%3D''18''%20fill%3D''%23fee2e2''%20stroke%3D''%23dc2626''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D''M120%20128%20L230%20128%20L230%20240%20C175%20223%20130%20183%20120%20128%20Z''%20fill%3D''%23dbeafe''%20stroke%3D''%232563eb''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpath%20d%3D''M250%20128%20L360%20128%20C358%20193%20315%20243%20250%20263%20Z''%20fill%3D''%23fee2e2''%20stroke%3D''%23dc2626''%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''175''%20cy%3D''70''%20r%3D''16''%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''175''%20y%3D''77''%20text-anchor%3D''middle''%20font-size%3D''19''%20font-weight%3D''700''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%3E1%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''180''%20cy%3D''160''%20r%3D''16''%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''180''%20y%3D''167''%20text-anchor%3D''middle''%20font-size%3D''19''%20font-weight%3D''700''%20fill%3D''%23fff''%3E2%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D''305''%20cy%3D''70''%20r%3D''16''%20fill%3D''%230f172a''%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D''305''%20y%3D''77''%20text-anchor%3D''mi